    "summary": "Errata giving new ranged profiles to Vertus Praetors and the Shield-Captain on Dawneagle Jetbike. Vertus hurricane bolter with [RAPID FIRE 3] and [TWIN-LINKED]: 18\" range, 3 attacks, BS 2+, Strength 4, AP -1, Damage 2. Salvo launcher with [TWIN-LINKED]: 24\" range, 1 attack, BS 2+, Strength 10, AP -3, Damage D6+1. Another Adeptus Custodes erratum, on Datasheets weapon characteristics, sets the Vertus hurricane bolter of these same two datasheets to Strength 5, so the two errata disagree on its Strength. Where the newer Adeptus Custodes codex is in force, this entry predates it, so the profiles it targets may no longer be printed there.",
